{"about":{"chairperson":{"name":"Er. Ram Bahadur Shrestha","title":"Chairperson, Smart Prefab Panel","message":"Since our founding, Smart Prefab Panel has been driven by a single purpose: to give Nepali families and businesses access to building technology that is safe, fast and affordable. The 2015 earthquake reminded all of us how important it is to build responsibly. Every panel that leaves our factory carries that responsibility with it. Thank you for trusting us to help build a stronger Nepal."},"mission":"To provide earthquake-resistant, energy-efficient and cost-effective prefabricated building solutions to every corner of Nepal, using globally proven EPS and PUF panel technology.","vision":"To become Nepal's most trusted name in prefabricated construction, recognized for quality, innovation and service across South Asia.","boardOfDirectors":[{"id":"1","name":"Er. Ram Bahadur Shrestha","position":"Chairperson","image":""},{"id":"2","name":"Mrs. Sita Koirala","position":"Director","image":""},{"id":"3","name":"Mr. Bikash Tamang","position":"Director","image":""},{"id":"4","name":"Mr. Hari Prasad Adhikari","position":"Independent Director","image":""}],"management":[{"id":"1","name":"Er. Suresh Maharjan","position":"Chief Executive Officer","image":""},{"id":"2","name":"Mrs. Anjali Rana","position":"Chief Financial Officer","image":""},{"id":"3","name":"Er. Deepak Gurung","position":"Head of Production","image":""},{"id":"4","name":"Mr. Nabin Shakya","position":"Head of Sales & Dealership","image":""}]}}